{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space shattered by failed experiments, a multitude of experimental creatures looking for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaving behind the sins that hold you captive to escape with only your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to escape with only your soul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366260/extras/609ed400bf703579a5b5c0cfd1623f68.poster.avif?t=1764120156\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366260/extras/609ed400bf703579a5b5c0cfd1623f68.webm?t=1764120156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366260/extras/609ed400bf703579a5b5c0cfd1623f68.mp4?t=1764120156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Device is a 2D platformer shooter with features of the roguelike genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way you will encounter various items that will strengthen you, equipment that will give you new abilities, and several weapons that will be responsible for your attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is only one goal in this game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To pick up a gun, defeat all the enemies that stand in your way and escape at the end of it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Numerous enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366260/extras/f4a80b698f073314c7e802e4d0470379.avif?t=1764120156\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of different types of enemies will target you in different types of labs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful bosses will frustrate you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may choose to retrace your steps if you want to be more prepared to deal with the enemies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But keep in mind. If you go back the way you came, the collapsing space will attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't give up, challenge, choose, and move on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366260/extras/370b598381fef70268f290ab736a0ed2.avif?t=1764120156\" width=600 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366260/extras/4f7e9bad5cff0cd62ea39a8f0daf6968.webp?t=1764120156\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you start your escape, you can customize your soul device's abilities with 6 different soul devices and 12 special symbols to get you started!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can have stronger combat abilities from the start, a stronger body, or more agile legs, depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this can be earned in your challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various items and equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366260/extras/ac1a52b8aebb105419cda39b0fab7341.avif?t=1764120156\" width=600 height=240 /></span>Enhance yourself with over 50 different items, gain multiple abilities with over 30 different pieces of equipment, and attack your enemies with over 40 different weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These will make you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >make you run faster, jump higher, move in new ways, block enemy attacks in more ways, and become more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Soul Device will change depending on which power-ups you get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional update support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll continue to introduce new content in the future. New modes, melee weapons, and unique play experiences are already in the works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for new modes, melee weapons, and unique play experiences.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"9a4706f6c21086695046552418159fd61a1cd7e6.jpg","localized_name":"The beginning of escape","name":"The beginning of escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1366260/9a4706f6c21086695046552418159fd61a1cd7e6.jpg"},{"icon":"3596168e4527a70e8eed07d3d8b7d550177d404d.jpg","localized_name":"Failed escape","name":"Failed escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1366260/3596168e4527a70e8eed07d3d8b7d550177d404d.jpg"},{"icon":"091ba0812dfbb74892bb4ea4219ca0c8cac40dca.jpg","localized_name":"Escape...?","name":"Escape...?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1366260/091ba0812dfbb74892bb4ea4219ca0c8cac40dca.jpg"},{"icon":"208bfad7dae0dffd55ade92921c6373a4a76dd71.jpg","localized_name":"Wealthy!","name":"Wealthy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1366260/208bfad7dae0dffd55ade92921c6373a4a76dd71.jpg"},{"icon":"e37823d90874bc44b713bf17ba423f29141a5873.jpg","localized_name":"Get back up, even after falling 10 times","name":"Get back up, even after falling 10 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1366260/e37823d90874bc44b713bf17ba423f29141a5873.jpg"},{"icon":"e21a809384ce0f74f811f045640f471c1373546b.jpg","localized_name":"Professor","name":"Professor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/13662