 steps if you want to be more prepared to deal with the enemies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But keep in mind. If you go back the way you came, the collapsing space will attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't give up, challenge, choose, and move on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366260/extras/370b598381fef70268f290ab736a0ed2.avif?t=1764120156\" width=600 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366260/extras/4f7e9bad5cff0cd62ea39a8f0daf6968.webp?t=1764120156\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you start your escape, you can customize your soul device's abilities with 6 different soul devices and 12 special symbols to get you started!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can have stronger combat abilities from the start, a stronger body, or more agile legs, depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this can be earned in your challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various items and equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366260/extras/ac1a52b8aebb105419cda39b0fab7341.avif?t=1764120156\" width=600 height=240 /></span>Enhance yourself with over 50 different items, gain multiple abilities with over 30 different pieces of equipment, and attack your enemies with over 40 different weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These will make you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >make you run faster, jump higher, move in new ways, block enemy attacks in more ways, and become more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Soul Device will change depending on which power-ups you get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional update support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll continue to introduce new content in the future. New modes, melee weapons, and unique play experiences are already in the works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for new modes, melee weapons, and unique play experiences.</p>","developers":["Gold Lemon Company"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1366260/header.jpg?t=1764120156","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1366260/641342/729068d12b65b50324ef50f252799bb4dd3ba897/1751227731/dash_av1.mpd?t=1702732246","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1366260/641342/729068d12b65b50324ef50f252799bb4dd3ba897/1751227731/dash_h264.mpd?t=1702732246","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1366260/641342/729068d12b65b50324ef50f252799bb4dd3ba897/1751227731/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1702732246","id":256989434,"name":"SOUL DEVICE trailer3","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256989434/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1702732246"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1366260/641340/a52711d33161a8573116fe6efd9bc7519f2f2c35/1751227730/dash_av1.mpd?t=1702732251","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1366260/641340/a52711d33161a8573116fe6efd9bc7519f2f2c35/1751227730/dash_h264.mpd?t=1702732251","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1366260/641340/a52711d33161a8573116fe6efd9bc7519f2f2c35/1751227730/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1702732251","id":256989432,"name":"SOUL DEVICE trailer2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256989432